# JOURNEY · the Mystery Net: choose a net by its price and cast it. What comes up is random, so the
# journey watches the strip rush and then walks away, which keeps the ticket.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
run /casino mysterynet
expect Mystery Net
expect Small Net
key right
expect Big Net $341
key left
expect ENTER cast
key enter
expect the net is out
snap the strip rushes under the marker
key esc
expect Leave the table?
key enter
expect ENTER sit down
key esc
